\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Taxonomic classification of bacterial isolates. Table showing the 50 ASV isolates used in the experiment. Each row shows the ASV identifier and its full taxonomic classification (Kingdom, Phylum, Class, Order, Family, Genus). Colors match those used in pie charts and composition figures throughout the manuscript.\relax }}{12}{figure.caption.20}\protected@file@percent }
